OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over fatal crash with
OL,4,Acyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with two counts
OL,7,Fof causing death by dangerous driving
OL,8,Fafter a car hit three cyclists.
OL,10,FKent Police said it had charged Aaron
OL,11,FTurner, 22, from Hermitage Road in
OL,12,FHigham, after the fatal crash near
OL,13,FGravesend on Sunday.
OL,15,FA man in his 60s and a woman in her 50s
OL,16,Fdied in the crash while the third
OL,17,Fcyclist was treated in hospital for
OL,18,Fminor injuries, officers said.
